      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have performed more tests based on real repositories. In those tests, I was not able to detect any performance improvements. There was no statistically significant difference in the time required to call `git ls-remote`.\nWithout measurable improvement, this change does not add any value. I will abandon it.",
      "revId": "fdd62f4067e23bcd3c643df1d65aa577f3504ba4",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
